data: {"id": "5131252f88244cc9-thinking-parallel_evidence-2040", "run_id": "5131252f88244cc9", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已采集的证据，以下是对 aiops-case-v17/workload 的详细分析：\n\n### 1. 已确认的事实 (Evidence)\n*   **生命周期与拓扑**: Pod `workload` (UID: `85aece07...`) 调度在 `node2` (IP: `10.2.0.50`) 上，Pod IP 为 `172.16.104.36`。容器为 `app`，基于 `python:3-alpine` 镜像。\n*   **当前状态**: Pod 状态为 `Running` 但处于 `CrashLoopBackOff`。容器 `app` 当前状态为 `Waiting`，上次状态为 `Terminated (Error, Exit Code: 137)`。重启计数已达 9 次。\n*   **探针失败**: \n    *   Liveness Probe (`http-get :18080/health`) 失败原因：`context deadline exceeded` (超时)。\n    *   Readiness Probe (`http-get :18080/rea", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1789392103735, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

