data: {"id": "5131252f88244cc9-final", "run_id": "5131252f88244cc9", "seq": 2045, "ts_ms": 1789392131824, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v17/workload` | RecentRestart | {'container': 'app', 'reason': 'Error'} |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.last_terminated_reason: Error` (fact-0ef0d2f99493) | 确认容器非正常退出，但 `Error` 未直接指明 OOMKilled，需结合 Exit Code 分析。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning Unhealthy ... Liveness probe failed: context deadline exceeded` (fact-1a8d7f85c448) | 证明在容器被杀前，应用响应已超时，排除了应用完全假死或崩溃导致无响应的可能。 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning BackOff ... Back-off restarting failed container` (fact-b77536b7e4b3) | 证实容器频繁重启且触发指数退避机制，反映故障持续发生。 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `resource_limit.memory: 64Mi` (fact-bb7656a78fc3), `resource_request.memory: 8Mi` (fact-2ba508332d23) | 确认存在极低的内存限制（64Mi），这是触发 OOMKilled 的高风险配置，为猜测 OOM 提供基础。 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total: 9` (fact-a5a0830ed95d) | 量化重启频率，与 K8s 事件中的 BackOff 状态对应。 |\n| 6 | Logging | elasticsearch | `GET /ready ... 200`, `GET /health ... 200`, `listening on 18080` (fact-046017c711de, fact-074d68251b50, fact-419c75f82558) | 证明应用进程至少在 13:19:49 之前是正常运行并监听服务的，说明崩溃是突发性的。 |\n| 7 | Tracing | deepflow | `L7 Flow: GET /health ... response_code: 200, duration_us: 3001057.0 ~ 3001920.0` (fact-3c0efe8d8c1b) | 追踪记录证实 `/health` 接口虽耗时极长（~3秒），但响应码始终为 200，支持“应用处理慢导致探针超时”的推测。 |\n\n**证据说明：**\n1-2, 5, 7 号证据互相印证：应用虽然在运行（日志 200 OK，Tracing 200 Code），但响应极慢导致 Liveness Probe 超时（K8s Event），进而导致 Kubelet 发起 Kill 动作。\n4 号证据（极低内存限制）解释了 Exit Code 137 的高概率成因（OOM），但 6 号证据（进程仍在监听）表明内存问题可能在最后时刻才触发，或存在其他资源竞争导致响应变慢。目前缺乏直接的 OOM 指标或 Terminated Reason 细节来完全锁定内存。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n疑似内存资源耗尽或进程处理阻塞 → 应用响应变慢导致 Liveness Probe 超时 → Kubelet 判定不健康并终止容器 (Exit 137) → 容器反复重启并进入 CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**证据不足。**\n\n当前证据链显示容器因 `Exit Code 137`（SIGKILL）异常退出，且伴随 Liveness Probe 超时和频繁重启。虽然配置中极低的内存限制（`64Mi`）使得 `OOMKilled` 成为最可能的根本原因，但现有事实存在以下缺口：\n1. 缺乏 `Terminated Reason` 为 `OOMKilled` 的直接字段证据（当前仅显示为 `Error`）。\n2. 缺乏 `container_memory_usage_bytes` 或 `oom_events` 等指标证明内存确实触顶。\n3. 虽然应用响应极慢（Tracing 显示耗时 ~3s）导致探针超时，但未能排除是因内存争用导致的“假死”还是其他资源/逻辑缺陷。\n\n在未获取到明确的 OOM 终止原因或内存飙升至 limit 的历史数据前，无法确诊根因为 OOMKilled。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 24.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 98.8s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v17/workload: 98.8s (Evidence 85.7s, RCA 12.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 14.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v17/workload**: pod-oomkilled, pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 138.419, "metrics": {"run_id": "5131252f88244cc9", "mttr": {"value": "2.3m", "seconds": 138.43533492088318, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "45%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-oomkilled, pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 138435.33492088318, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 107996.34718894958, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 14, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 41122.20311164856, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 29852.663278579712}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 24702.194213867188, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 98817.08121299744, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 14883.462905883789, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

